{"id":"mismo","lemma":"mismo","pos":"adj","rank":117,"glosses":["same; identical; one and the same; indicates that the two compared noun clauses both represent the one thing","similar; alike; practically identical; indicates that the two compared noun clauses have one or more matching qualities","self; emphasizes the identity or singularity of the modified noun phrase"],"ipa":"/ˈmismo/","forms":{"feminine":"misma","masculinePlural":"mismos","femininePlural":"mismas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mismo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenemos el mismo problema.","en":"We have the same problem.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516210","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Ellos tienen la misma edad.","en":"They're the same age.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454405","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Todos estamos en el mismo barco.","en":"We're all in the same boat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609760","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"boat"}]},{"text":"Vamos a la misma escuela.","en":"We go to the same school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/43231","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Empezamos al mismo tiempo.","en":"We started at the same time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642321","words":[{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"time"}]}]}